tei:div.tei:p:
By the Sabbath command God makes you strong;
Arise, call upon him: soon will he strengthen you;
Read the prayers, Nishmath and Kedushah,
Then eat with joy, for he is pleased with you.

Recite the day’s Kiddush over twin loaves;
Be generous with abundant dainties;
All who enjoy the Sabbath shall merit
The future world when the redeemer comes.
